{"3543300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Medic Mayhem", "steam_appid": 3543300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medic Mayhem is a fast-paced action game that puts you behind the wheel of an ambulance on chaotic toy battlefields. Pick up fallen soldiers, rush them to your hospital and send them back into battle on your side. Destroy the enemy base and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step 1:</strong> Rescue fallen soldiers<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/140c03314fb2cce5229b10f51c4f57e5.poster.avif?t=1787324440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/140c03314fb2cce5229b10f51c4f57e5.webm?t=1787324440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/140c03314fb2cce5229b10f51c4f57e5.mp4?t=1787324440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step 2:</strong> Rush them to your hospital</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/ccf8331925ece4d50e30fdc5bde4ed29.poster.avif?t=1787324440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/ccf8331925ece4d50e30fdc5bde4ed29.webm?t=1787324440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/ccf8331925ece4d50e30fdc5bde4ed29.mp4?t=1787324440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step 3:</strong> Win the war!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/dd94bcd2161ad4ec884e4fb696b53be4.poster.avif?t=1787324440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/dd94bcd2161ad4ec884e4fb696b53be4.webm?t=1787324440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/dd94bcd2161ad4ec884e4fb696b53be4.mp4?t=1787324440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and frantic:</strong> Race to the front line, outmaneuver your opponents and rescue more soldiers than the enemy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus or co-op:</strong> Local multiplayer for up to four players: compete against each other or team up against bots!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power up your ambulance:</strong> Grab power-ups like the troop magnet and dynamite to gain an edge in battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toy-box battlefields:</strong> Fight in the playroom, a real sandbox and a bathroom overflowing with bubbles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No language barrier:</strong> With no in-game text, anyone can jump in and play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into Medic Mayhem and prove your skills on its chaotic toy battlefields. Can you win the war by saving lives?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medic Mayhem is a fast-paced action game that puts you behind the wheel of an ambulance on chaotic toy battlefields. Pick up fallen soldiers, rush them to your hospital and send them back into battle on your side. Destroy the enemy base and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step 1:</strong> Rescue